restart_address   0x00000e48  uint8_t *%s
program_end       0x0003a670  uint8_t %s[]      the end of the program as the loader reads it: the memory map begins here
voice             0x0002034c  struct Voice %s[4]   the four voices of the sound system (the state of the sound system goes on after them)
voice_buffers     0x0002061c  uint8_t %s[]      a buffer of 128 bytes for each voice
sound_lock        0x0002079c  uint8_t %s        $FF while the sound system is being set up
