frame_toggle       0x00000196  uint16_t %s   flipped every frame of the game loop
frame_phase       0x000001e4  uint16_t %s   0, 1, 0, 1 ...: counts the frames of the loop in twos
timer_306         0x00000306  int16_t %s   counted down to 0 once a frame
